  "description": "Live showcase of four Grafana 13 features: (1) chained template variables — Namespace → Pod → Container drill-down; (2) tabs with section-scoped variables; (3) conditional rendering — rows appear/disappear based on View Mode, no-data hiding via data-presence rules; (4) responsive layout with clearly structured rows and tabs. Built on real Prometheus + Testdata sources.",
