          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        },
        "content": "## 🔗 Feature 1 — Chained Template Variables\nUse the **Namespace → Pod → Container** dropdowns above. Each selection narrows the next list in real time. Panel queries use regex-match syntax so multi-select scopes all three at once.\n\n## 🎭 Feature 2 — Conditional Rendering\nChange **View Mode** to `Detailed` to reveal the hidden breakdown row below — no page reload required. The row reappears or vanishes instantly as you switch.",
